      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "This application is being filed on behalf of the petitioners for quashing the order dated 24.05.2012 passed in Complaint Case No. 748C of 2011 by Sub-Divisional Magistrate, Khagaria by which the cognizance against the petitioners have been taken for the offence under Section 498A of the IPC.\nPatna High Court CR.",
